id: pm-jira-9h54
title: Plan permitted Jira lifecycle transitions before writes
description: Discover issue-scoped Jira transitions and required fields; produce a read-only explicit plan or typed refusal with remedies.
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-22T15:19:29.714Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-22T15:33:36.856Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: "Synthetic workflows with intermediate states and permission failures refuse impossible plans before writes.; Typed SDK and CLI emit compact TOON/JSON; no-git tracker support, documentation and measured public tracker validation."
comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-22T15:19:48.550Z",codex-agent,"Overlap recheck: pinned pm SDK owns lifecycle status validation, certified complete tracker reads and command rendering; pm-jira owns status/category mapping, pm-linear resolves team workflow states, pm-ado maps Azure states. None discovers Jira issue-scoped transition permissions or transition-screen required fields. Keep this read-only planner provider-specific. Jira current-user transition discovery cannot certify future-state permissions: refuse indirect plans, list permitted next steps, and require rediscovery after each externally executed intermediate step. No transition execution or sibling/core changes."
  "2026-10-22T15:27:07.895Z",codex-agent,"Targeted tests passed 4/4 via pm test --run --progress (0 skipped). Typecheck, test typecheck and docstring lint pass. Public main corpus 01fb41c6625106f4f18f1927cd65367ef3dc374f: 104 items (90 closed, 6 open, 5 in_progress, 2 blocked, 1 canceled). Filesystem read-only non-git copy, SDK certified complete read; 103 supported items x 4 synthetic Jira workflow snapshots = 412 plans: 13 ready, 26 no_permitted_transition, 13 fields_required, 360 noop. Largest JSON 336 bytes; full copied tree hashes unchanged, no cache additions, 0 Jira writes. Canceled counted but excluded from existing four-state adapter. This is real public lifecycle data plus synthetic Jira metadata, not a live tenant test. Writable-copy preflight exposed SDK runtime cache creation; read-only-copy measurement passed without changes."
  "2026-10-22T15:28:20.952Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof: replacing only the no-permitted-transition guard with a ready receipt made node --test --test-name-pattern=\"planner refuses\" test/transition-plans.test.ts fail 0/1 (ready != refused). Removing only the required-field guard made node --test --test-name-pattern=\"transition screens\" test/transition-plans.test.ts fail 0/1. Restored both guards; focused suite passes 4/4. Actual installed CLI covered ready/refused JSON and TOON with correct exit codes on a non-git tracker and empty PATH. Targeted tests, tsc and docstring lint only locally; full unchanged 100% thresholds run in CI for npm and Bun."
  "2026-10-22T15:29:03.912Z",codex-agent,"Final receipt shape now includes destination status ID as well as its name. Repeated public corpus measurement: same 104 items and 412 outcomes, maximum compact JSON receipt 347 bytes, unchanged filesystem-read-only copied tree. Discovery follows the official Jira current-user transitions endpoint. CI uses complete npm and Bun release:check commands on Node 22 and 26; thresholds and pinned dependencies unchanged."
  "2026-10-22T15:33:35.411Z",codex-agent,"Final SDK integration: refusal receipts use the pinned host structured-result exit_code and remediation contract, not process-wide exitCode mutation. Harness verifies exitCode/errorCode/remediation propagation and unchanged embedding process status; installed CLI JSON/TOON refusal exits remain 2. Focused final suite 4/4, identity/privacy suite 4/4 with isolated HOME/Git config, typecheck/test typecheck/docstring lint pass. Repeated public read-only corpus still 412 identical outcomes and zero changes; final maximum JSON 366 bytes including structured host recovery fields. PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-jira/pull/155 holds CI run URL/count receipts when complete. Automated review gaps: Greptile trial ended, Sourcery budget exhausted, CodeRabbit automatic review skipped. No review approval claimed."
